{"abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by MISO.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and MISO considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and MISO cannot only rely on the OS version.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus, this ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"**You must use this ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"text":" to YES **.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["  MISOTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(MISOLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 3.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misoc